<title>USA: St Joseph hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with</p>
<p>Tuesday, barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Interior Iowa</p>
<p>moved 116,000 hogs Tuesday. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	230-270 lbs    49.50-50.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3	270-290 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
<p>Sows - off $0.50-1.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-2	300-450 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>		    450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>    US 1-3	500-550 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>		    550-700 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
<p>    Boars:	300-700 lbs    42.00</p>
<p>		    200-300 lbs    43.00</p>
</text>
